   "source": [
    "# 9. Preparing data for publication\n",
    "\n",
    "The state-of-the art of data is the NetCDF format, and comminuty standard formatting (CF and ACDD).\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
